@page "/about"

<PageTitle>About - Natural Dental Lab</PageTitle>

<div class="info-page">
    <section class="info-hero">
        <span class="eyebrow">About Natural Dental Lab</span>
        <h1>Dental laboratory manufacturing supported by secure operations.</h1>
        <p>
            Natural Dental Lab manufactures patient-specific dental products
            for doctors and dental clinics. The operations platform connects
            laboratory case entry, doctor-specific pricing, production units,
            controlled approvals, and billing visibility.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-grid">
        <article>
            <span>01</span>
            <h2>Doctor-focused service</h2>
            <p>Doctors and clinics are the commercial customers for laboratory work created for individual patient cases.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>02</span>
            <h2>Controlled production records</h2>
            <p>Each case records the dental product, teeth or arch, units, historical rate, amount, notes, and audit details.</p>
        </article>
        <article>
            <span>03</span>
            <h2>Operational governance</h2>
            <p>Role-based access and approval workflows protect case corrections, cancellations, billing, and user administration.</p>
        </article>
    </section>
</div>
